{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471932",
      "title": "Animating Shared Elements",
      "sourceHash": "aa903235a7990a56173ca6e84f83f2cace225c029252e050876331ef0684572b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 2.58,
          "en": "So with all these steps taken,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.58,
          "end": 5.37,
          "en": "these tabs here look pretty nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.37,
          "end": 8.223,
          "en": "but there are two final things here I want to improve.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.18,
          "end": 12.03,
          "en": "The first thing that could be improved is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.03,
          "end": 15.48,
          "en": "that if we switch from an empty tab with no items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.48,
          "end": 20.48,
          "en": "to a tab with items, those items don't really animate in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.39,
          "end": 24.09,
          "en": "Instead they just pop in like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.09,
          "end": 26.253,
          "en": "and that's okay, but not great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.48,
          "end": 29.7,
          "en": "The other thing I want to improve is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.7,
          "end": 31.92,
          "en": "that this bar should be animated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.92,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "between those different tabs as we switch tabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 39.303,
          "en": "so that this bar should smoothly switch between those tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 43.983,
          "en": "But we'll start with animating those items that appear here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.15,
          "end": 48.66,
          "en": "And all we need to do here to make this look better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.66,
          "end": 51.75,
          "en": "is go back to Challenges.jsx.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.75,
          "end": 53.52,
          "en": "And here on this ordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.52,
          "end": 55.86,
          "en": "where we set up an exit animation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.86,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "we need to add an animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 59.793,
          "en": "that's being played as this list appears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.23,
          "end": 65.4,
          "en": "And here I'll just grab the initial and animate prop values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.4,
          "end": 67.95,
          "en": "from this fallback paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.95,
          "end": 71.013,
          "en": "because I wanna play the same animation here for the list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 74.61,
          "en": "So on this ordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.61,
          "end": 78.513,
          "en": "I'll add these initial and animate props with those values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.77,
          "end": 84,
          "en": "And with that, now if we move to a different tab",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84,
          "end": 86.88,
          "en": "with no items and back to a tab with items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 89.43,
          "en": "this list appears in a nicer way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.43,
          "end": 91.23,
          "en": "So that's looking good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.23,
          "end": 94.32,
          "en": "So let's say for now focus on this bar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.32,
          "end": 96.21000000000001,
          "en": "And animating this bar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.21000000000001,
          "end": 99.12,
          "en": "so that it moves between these tabs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.12,
          "end": 102.87,
          "en": "probably sounds pretty complex and difficult",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.87,
          "end": 105.72,
          "en": "but thankfully it's not difficult at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.72,
          "end": 107.82,
          "en": "Because Framer Motion has a feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.82,
          "end": 110.97999999999999,
          "en": "that's built specifically for use cases like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.9,
          "end": 114.15,
          "en": "where you have some shared element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.15,
          "end": 117.53999999999999,
          "en": "that needs to move around in your UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.53999999999999,
          "end": 121.8,
          "en": "And it's important to note here that in challenge tabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 125.373,
          "en": "which is where this bar is in yet located,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.36,
          "end": 130.11,
          "en": "here in this tab component, that in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 133.77,
          "en": "we're dealing with three different bars here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.77,
          "end": 137.94,
          "en": "Every tap gets its own bar that's shown conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 140.013,
          "en": "if that tab is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.27,
          "end": 145.8,
          "en": "So it's technically not one DOM element that moves around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.8,
          "end": 148.17000000000002,
          "en": "Instead, we have three DOM elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.17000000000002,
          "end": 150.63,
          "en": "that are added or removed from the DOM",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.63,
          "end": 153.03300000000002,
          "en": "depending on which tab is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.87,
          "end": 156.96,
          "en": "And still, Framer Motion has a built-in feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.96,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "that makes animating use cases like this a breeze",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 164.16,
          "en": "because all we have to do is to go to this place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.16,
          "end": 167.64,
          "en": "where this shared element kind of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.64,
          "end": 170.5,
          "en": "is created in JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.45,
          "end": 174.933,
          "en": "and convert this element to a motion component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.8,
          "end": 178.86,
          "en": "So to a motion.div in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.86,
          "end": 183.03,
          "en": "And for that, I first must import motion into this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.03,
          "end": 186.603,
          "en": "So import motion from Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.19,
          "end": 190.95,
          "en": "And now with this element being converted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.95,
          "end": 194.67,
          "en": "we can add a special new prop on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.67,
          "end": 197.13,
          "en": "And that's the layout ID prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.13,
          "end": 199.323,
          "en": "So not layout but layoutId.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 201.06,
          "end": 202.53,
          "en": "And as the name suggests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.53,
          "end": 205.44,
          "en": "here you should assign an ID to this element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.44,
          "end": 207.843,
          "en": "for example tab-indicator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.98,
          "end": 212.79,
          "en": "And now with that layout Id added to a motion element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 212.79,
          "end": 216.21,
          "en": "Framer Motion will do some magic behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 216.21,
          "end": 219.42000000000002,
          "en": "It will basically automatically detect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.42000000000002,
          "end": 222.45,
          "en": "whenever you are rendering another element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.45,
          "end": 227.16,
          "en": "with the same layoutId in a different place of your page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 227.16,
          "end": 230.313,
          "en": "and it will automatically play a smooth animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 231.57,
          "end": 234.57,
          "en": "So therefore, here with this layoutId added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234.57,
          "end": 237.9,
          "en": "if we save this, that's all we have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 237.9,
          "end": 241.983,
          "en": "to get this nice animation of this bar below our tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 243.33,
          "end": 244.77,
          "en": "And therefore, now I'd argue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.77,
          "end": 247.23,
          "en": "that these tabs look rather nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.23,
          "end": 250.32,
          "en": "and as you saw, we were able to build this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.32,
          "end": 253.233,
          "en": "with just a handful of Framer features.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}